    {
        "id": 8,
        "name": "About Us",
        "sub_title": "ECW",
        "slug": "about-us",
        "category_id": 1147483651,
        "banner_id": 44,
        "description": "<div class=\"sci-bg \"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-md-4\"><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\">Who We Are</span></h3></div><div class=\"col-md-8\"><p>We support and protect holistic learning outcomes for refugee, internally displaced and other crisis-affected girls and boys, so no one is left behind.</p><p>ECW is administered under UNICEF&rsquo;s financial, human resources, and administrative rules and regulations; operations are run by the Fund&rsquo;s own independent governance structure.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"sci-bg \"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-md-12\"><h3 id=\"tw-target-text\" class=\"tw-data-text tw-text-large tw-ta\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-placeholder=\"Translation\">Our work is anchored in two strategic objectives to address the most critical and persistent challenges to closing the quality education gap</h3></div></div></div></div><div class=\"sci-bg \"><div class=\"container\"><br /><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-md-6\"><img class=\"img-thumbnail\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"http://localhost:8000/storage/photos/1/About/icon_sp1.png\" alt=\"\" /></div><div class=\"col-md-6\">Increased and better funding for EiEPC&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</div></div></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-md-5\"><img class=\"img-thumbnail\" style=\"float: right;\" src=\"http://localhost:8000/storage/photos/1/About/untitled-7.png\" alt=\"\" /></div><div class=\"col-md-7\">Stronger EiEPC capacities and systems</div></div></div></div></div><p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"sci-bg \"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-md-6\"><p><img class=\"w-100\" src=\"http://localhost:8000/storage/photos/1/About/Group 76658.png\" alt=\"\" /></p></div><div class=\"col-md-6\"><h3>Our Mission</h3><p>ECW works to generate greater shared political, operational and financial commitment to meet the educational needs of millions of children and youth affected by crises, with a focus on more agile, connected and faster response that spans the humanitarian-development continuum to lay the ground for sustainable education systems.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>Our Vision</h3><p>A world where all children and youth affected by crises can learn free of cost &ndash; in safety and without fear &ndash; in order to grow and reach their full potential.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"sci-bg \"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-md-12\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">ECW was launched to transform the aid system that currently leaves behind millions of the most vulnerable children and youth on the planet. The Fund&rsquo;s strategy is designed to address the obstacles that have prevented humanitarian and development actors from delivering quality education in humanitarian crises.</p></div></div></div></div><p>&nbsp;</p></div></div>",
